--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Parts of this bundle are derived from packages of the Sonata Project (https://github.com/sonata-project):
sonata-project/admin-bundle, block-bundle, doctrine-orm-admin-bundle, form-extensions and twig-extensions. These
parts are under the license below:

- assets/js/sonata/: the Stimulus controllers of SonataAdminBundle, taken over with small changes
- assets/js/controllers/edit_controller.js: adapted from the edit controller of SonataAdminBundle
- templates/sonata/: the templates that replace Sonata's, adapted from them
- reference/: copies of Sonata's templates and scripts, unchanged

